<title>UK: Ex-dividends to take 1.36 off FTSE, July 7.</title>
<headline>Ex-dividends to take 1.36 off FTSE, July 7.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following FTSE-100 stocks will go ex-dividend on July 7 and analysts estimate this will take 1.36 points off the index on Monday.</p>
<p>					   DIVIDEND	INDEX</p>
<p>					   (PENCE)	 EFFECT</p>
<p>		 COMPANY		Net   Gross     Gross</p>
<p> * Carlton Communications	 4.90   6.125    0.208</p>
<p> * Railtrack Group		 14.80  18.500    0.518</p>
<p> * Thames Water		    23.20  29.000    0.638</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 5113</p>
</text>
